Description: Implements the non-asymptotically valid and asymptotically exact
  confidence intervals in two cases:
  estimation of the mean, and estimation of (a linear combination of)
  the coefficients in a linear regression model,
  following  (Derumigny, Girard and Guyonvarch, 2025)
  <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2507.16776>.
